  "problem": "$\\frac{1}{10}\\times 10=$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we write $10$ as an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n10=\\frac{10}{1}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify:\n\n$$\n10÷10=1\n$$",
